                <pb facs="0533" n="451" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg451"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Marquis de Montholon to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of France to the United
                                States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-12-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 9, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I hasten to acknowledge the reception of
                    your excellency’s note of the 6th December, in answer to my communication of the
                    29th ultimo.</p>
                <p>I will not fail to transmit, without delay, this important document to the
                    government of the Emperor.</p>
                <p>Accept the assurances of my high consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MONTHOLON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c., Washington, D.
                        C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
